THE CLIFF FILE: produced by Relentless Aaron
Style: Halftone Dossier, from the Lemo-Opuscar film library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar); engine helpers adapted from its demo.

PICTURE
- All artwork (mountain goat, kid, ibex, golden eagle and mountain lion characters, halftone dots, stamps, paper, grain, transitions) drawn procedurally in index.html (SVG + Canvas 2D). No photos or images.
- Rendering: Playwright (Apache-2.0) driving headless Chromium; encoding with FFmpeg (libx264).

VOICE
- Narration: Kokoro TTS (Apache-2.0), voice "am_onyx". A synthetic voice.

MUSIC AND SOUND EFFECTS
- Score and every sound effect synthesized from scratch by music.py (NumPy, SciPy). No samples.

FONTS (Google Fonts, all SIL Open Font License 1.1; https://openfontlicense.org)
- Alfa Slab One (JM Solé): headlines
- Bagel Fat One (Kyungwon Kim): numerals
- JetBrains Mono (JetBrains): case numbers, HUD
- Archivo Black (Omnibus-Type): captions, stamps
- Chewy (Squid Art): reserved for interjections

FACTS: see RESEARCH.md for every claim and its source (National Park Service, Britannica, NWF, Hamel & Côté 2009, BC Ministry of Environment, reporting on the Cingino Dam). Claims the sources disagree on were left out.

